  "$comment": "SecDrill enum and error-code catalog. Single machine-readable source for values defined in docs/00, 13, 14, 15, 16. scripts/check.py verifies that schema.sql, openapi.yaml and event.schema.json agree with it; application code tests against it. Changing a value is a contract change.",
